Skia
----

The blur arithmetic, the nine-patch geometry and the rect contour test in the
following files are ports of Skia (https://skia.org), Copyright Google LLC and
The Android Open Source Project, licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License
(see LICENSES/Skia-BSD-3-Clause.txt). These files remain under that license:

  obvid/rust/src/skia/plan_gauss.rs     SkMaskBlurFilter.cpp
  obvid/rust/src/skia/small_blur.rs     SkMaskBlurFilter.cpp, SkGaussFilter.cpp
  obvid/rust/src/skia/sigma.rs          SkBlurMask.cpp, SkBlurMaskFilterImpl.cpp,
                                        SkMaskBlurFilter.cpp, SkMatrix.cpp
  obvid/rust/src/skia/mask.rs           SkBlurMask.cpp, SkMask.cpp,
                                        SkMaskBlurFilter.cpp
  obvid/rust/src/shadow/nine.rs         SkBlurMaskFilterImpl.cpp, SkRRect.cpp
  obvid/rust/src/shadow/rects.rs        SkBlurMaskFilterImpl.cpp
  obvid/rust/src/shadow/rects_tests.rs  SkBlurMaskFilterImpl.cpp,
                                        SkMaskFilterBase.cpp (test-only port)
  obvid/src/main/kotlin/dev/serhiiyaremych/obvid/builder/SkiaRects.kt
                                        SkPathPriv.cpp

The NEON blur (obvid/rust/src/blur.rs, obvid/rust/src/blur/passes.rs,
obvid/rust/src/neon/box3.rs) is our own code under Apache-2.0 that computes
the same arithmetic as Skia's SkMaskBlurFilter.

The ports follow Skia main at commit 81ee7327e81c23b8bcf815ea6c353457cf706716
and AOSP platform/external/skia android17-release at commit
508606366e71a3daa933a4e08bc49b84e387ec18. The radius-to-sigma conversion
follows Android's frameworks/base libs/hwui/jni/MaskFilter.cpp
(The Android Open Source Project, Apache-2.0).


